== Effects ==
* Removes Isaac's oldest [[passive item]] (ignoring starting items) and creates 2 random item pedestals from the current room's item pool. '''Does nothing if Isaac has no items.'''

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: Removes 2 items and spawns 4.
** {{I|Tarot Cloth}} + {{i|Blank Card}}: Only removes one item and spawns two when used by Blank card.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Book of Virtues}}: Will be removed because it is also considered a passive item.
* {{i|Damocles}}: '''XVII - The Stars?''' does not remove the passive sword item created by Damocles.
* {{i|Eden's Blessing}}: Items granted by Eden's Blessing are considered starting items by the effect of '''XVII - The Stars?'''. Thus, only the first item picked up within the current run is removed.

